<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Grupo Alfa started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Grupo Alfa started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Mexican brokerage Interacciones began coverage of conglomerate Grupo Industrial Alfa S.A. with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Robert Hulme said the prospects for the company's steel and chemical businesses are bright after a strong 1995, citing capacity and volume expansion.</p>
</text>
